Package: pkgstyle
Title: Shared pkgdown Site Style for Nonprofit Open Data Collective Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pkgdown template package. Packages that set
    'template: package: pkgstyle' in their _pkgdown.yml get the shared NODC
    site style: navy and burnt-orange colours, Zilla Slab headings, Source
    Sans 3 body text, quiet ruled tables and a light/dark switch. Also ships
    instructions for a coding agent that sets up the documentation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    pkgdown (>= 2.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/pkgstyle
BugReports: https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/pkgstyle/issues
